PRINTFORML Humans who don't fear her and can explain the unknown with science are her greatest enemies.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML Her appearance is quite stark, with strange wings sprouting from her back. As a nue youkai,
PRINTFORML she can shapeshift and conceal her true form, which is...
PRINTFORML Let's just say, it's hidden in plain sight. But she still feels embarrassed when it's revealed.
PRINTFORML She often asks others to identify her true form as a way to start a conversation.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML Currently she lives at the Myouren Temple, mostly skipping her training and feeling immensely bored with her daily life,
PRINTFORML looking for a thrill at any opportunity.
PRINTFORML Perhaps a newcomer will be able to provide her with that...
