;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;"ENCOUNTER"系イベント（エクストラ構文）
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
@M_KOJO_ENCOUNTER_K41
;初対面、挨拶のタイミング
;TALENTの変更はここでどうぞ。
PRINTL
PRINTFORMDW Out of nowhere, a strange object passes before your eyes.
PRINTFORMDL Curious about what is going on, you give chase after it to catch it.
PRINTFORMDW After several minutes of desperate struggle, you stand triumphant, having captured the object at long last.
PRINTFORMDW Then, to your surprise, the odd object simply transformed into a snake.
PRINTL
CALL PRINT_FACE, 41, "通常", "服"
PRINTFORMW 「Oh, hey, my bad. That, uh... belongs to me.」
PRINTL
PRINTFORMDL A voice suddenly called from behind you.
PRINTFORMDW Turning around, you see a strange-looking girl with red and blue tentacle-like wings growing from her back.
;added
PRINTFORMDW Dressed in all black, and a somewhat messy dark hair curiously winding to the side, there's no doubt that this girl is a youkai.
PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG(@"The only exception to the all black rule is her cute ribbon on her \@ TALENT:バストサイズ < 0 ? small and perky # shapely and attractive\@ chest, and her shoes that have a ribbon on them as well, both red. There's also an interesting looking red pattern on her skirt, which probably means something.")%
PRINTFORMDW Not to mention her bright red eyes, which almost shine as she looks at you.
PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG(@"\@ TALENT:体型 < 0 ? Despite her short stature, her # Her \@ legs are long and pretty, covered with black socks that go up to her thighs. The part that reveals her skin between her skirt and her socks looks strangely alluring...")%
PRINTFORMDW Realizing you're checking her out, the girl lets out a chuckle, seemingly not bothered by it too much.
;--
PRINTL
PRINTFORMW 「That's a Seed of Unknown Form, it's part of my ability.」
PRINTFORMW 「That thing just swoops and flies away sometimes, y'know.」
PRINTL
PRINTFORMDW The girl takes the snake from you and puts it in her pocket.
PRINTL
PRINTFORML 「I haven't introduced myself yet, have I? I am Houjuu Nue.」
;added, specify the living position
IF MAIN_MAP == 1
	IF AT_HOME(MASTER)
		PRINTFORML 「I live here, in the temple.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「I'm one of the residents at the temple you've moved in.」
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORML 「Well, seeing that you're one of the residents as well, we were bound to meet each other sooner or later.」
	PRINTFORMDW The girl extends her hand for a handshake.
ELSE
	PRINTFORML 「I live at the Myouren Temple. Y'know, that spooky scary youkai temple!」
	PRINTFORMDW The girl tries to makes it sound eerie, but it doesn't seem to work very well.
ENDIF
PRINTL
PRINTFORMW 「So, uhh... What was your name again?」
IF MASTERNAME:41 == ""
	PRINTFORMDW Input a name.
	CALL NAME_SET_K41
	PRINTFORMW 「Hmm, so you're %MASTERNAME:41% then. Good to know.」
ELSE
	PRINTFORMDW The girl thinks for a moment before realizing that she already knew who you are.
	PRINTFORMW 「...Ooh right, you're that %MASTERNAME:41%! Sorry, I'm still not good at remembering huma-- I mean, people.」
ENDIF
;added
IF GETBIT(CFLAG:31, 0) || GETBIT(CFLAG:31, 1)
	PRINTFORMW （Hmm... Something tells me we already had this exact same conversation before...）
	PRINTFORMW （But it can't be, right? I've never met this %PRINT_MALE("guy", MASTER)% before, right?）
	PRINTFORMW （Must be my imagination then...）
ENDIF
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML 「...By the way %MASTERNAME:41%, about my snake. Each person perceives it differently, so I'd like to know...」
PRINTFORMW 「What did it look like?」
PRINTFORMDL ※This question will affect Nue's traits and the ease of getting along with her
PRINTDL [ 0]Unidentified Flying Object, in other words a UFO
PRINTDL [ 1]Flying treasure ship
PRINTDL [ 2]RC-model from the Outside World
PRINTDL [ 3]Gorgeous swallowtail butterfly
PRINTDL [ 4]Show quick explanation (Spoilers)
$INPUT_LOOP_FIRSTCONTACT
INPUT
IF RESULT == 0
	PRINTFORMW 「Hmm, that's a very ordinary response, exactly what a human would say.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Well, it's not like this alone will tell me everything I need to know about a person.」
	PRINTFORMW 「I'll have to take a closer look at you and see if I can uncover your... %MASTERNAME:41%'s true identity.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Though that said, you're never going to find out who I truly am. Try as you might, kukuku...!」
	PRINTFORMDW Nue seemed to get the impression that you were just a normal human.
	CFLAG:1001 = 1
ELSEIF RESULT == 1
	PRINTFORMW 「Hee-h, you sound just like the others around here.」
	PRINTFORMW 「That's a very old-fashioned way of thinking for someone so young and modern.」
	PRINTFORMW 「You piqued my interest there juuuust a little, %MASTERNAME:41%. You should come by and talk to me sometime.」
	PRINTFORMW 「I'll tell you a little bit about myself when I feel like it.」
	PRINTFORMDW Nue seemed to be interested in you as someone slightly different from other humans.
	CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"Nue got [%GET_TALENTNAME_TR(31, 1)%]!",C_YELLOW,2,1)
	CFLAG:1001 = 2
	TALENT:31 = 1
ELSEIF RESULT == 2
	PRINTFORMW 「For someone who lives in Gensokyo, you don't believe in fantasy or illusions one bit, do ya?」
	PRINTFORMW 「A tainted human, coated with the toxins of so-called science...」
	PRINTFORMW 「I wonder how long will you be able to maintain such a boring outlook in this land?」
	PRINTFORMW 「Kuku, this is gonna be fun to find out!」
	PRINTFORMDW Looks like your response made Nue act somewhat antagonistic towards you...
	CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"Nue got [%GET_TALENTNAME_TR(13, 1)%], [%GET_TALENTNAME_TR(25, 1)%] and [%GET_TALENTNAME_TR(32, 1)%]!",C_YELLOW,2,1)
	CFLAG:1001 = 3
	TALENT:13 = 1
	TALENT:25 = 1
	TALENT:32 = 1
ELSEIF RESULT == 3
	PRINTFORMW 「Pbffft! Aahahahahahaha! What kind of response is that?! That's friggin' hilarious!」
	PRINTFORMW 「You're quite the happy-go-lucky dreamer, aren'tcha? Kukuku...」
	PRINTFORMW 「I've never heard anyone talk about me like that before.」
	PRINTFORMW 「I like it. I'll be sure to play with ya from now on once in a while.」
	PRINTFORMDW Nue seemed to take a liking to you as someone quite interesting for a human.
	CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"Nue got [%GET_TALENTNAME_TR(24, 1)%], [%GET_TALENTNAME_TR(31, 1)%], and lost [%GET_TALENTNAME_TR(12, 1)%]!",C_YELLOW,2,1)
	CFLAG:1001 = 4
	TALENT:24 = 1
	TALENT:31 = 1
	TALENT:12 = 0
ELSEIF RESULT == 4
	PRINTDL Unidentified Flying Object, in other words a UFO (No change, default experience)
	PRINTDL Flying treasure ship (Adds [Liberated], slightly easier)
	PRINTDL RC-model from the Outside World (Hard Mode, adds various troublesome traits)
	PRINTDL Gorgeous swallowtail butterfly (Easy Mode, adds traits that make it easier to progress)
	WAIT
	GOTO INPUT_LOOP_FIRSTCONTACT
ELSE
	GOTO INPUT_LOOP_FIRSTCONTACT
ENDIF
;added
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORMDL Would you like to let Nue warm up to you with each gained relationship stage?
PRINTFORMDL With this, Nue's traits will change after gaining Affection, Love and Lover.
CALL ASK_YN
IF !RESULT
	PRINTFORMDL Soften Nue mode enabled!
